        <div class="arch-preview-item" style="border-left: 6px solid var(--cyan);">
          <span class="api-num">ARCHETYPE 2</span>
          <h4>Industrial Deep In-Order Core (CVA6 / Ariane &bull; ~148 kGE)</h4>
          <p>6-stage decoupled scoreboard pipeline with standardized AXI4-64b system bus interface, 16 PMP regions, and branch prediction. Hardened for industrial SoC tapeouts.</p>
