        <div class="arch-preview-item" style="border-left: 6px solid var(--coral);">
          <span class="api-num">ARCHETYPE 3</span>
          <h4>Modular Coherent Multi-Core Cluster Tile (BlackParrot &bull; ~165 kGE)</h4>
