        <div class="pareto-sub">4 KiB (342 MB/s) &rarr; 32 KiB (512 MB/s)</div>
        <p class="pareto-desc">Eliminating cache thrashing on linear sweeps delivers massive gains with only a modest +53 kGE silicon area penalty.</p>
      </div>
